WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.317
Several serving tools can expose local or self-hosted models.

00:00:04.317 --> 00:00:12.762
vee L L M is commonly used for high-throughput G P U serving, llama dot C P P is useful for portable and quantized

00:00:12.762 --> 00:00:20.457
local inference, oh llama simplifies local model management, and hugging face T G I is another production-oriented

00:00:20.457 --> 00:00:28.042
serving option. The application architecture should not depend conceptually on only one of them.

00:00:28.042 --> 00:00:33.012
Do not memorize one product as the architecture.

00:00:33.012 --> 00:00:38.148
The stable idea is the boundary between the application and the inference service.
